namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIPopupLayer {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamUIPopupLayer.h#DreamUIPopupLayer
    src   "The top layer transient UI is lifted to: dropdown lists and menus, as a per-player menu stack (Push, Dismiss).\nElevate and Restore are the lift alone, kept for owners that manage the rest themselves; the paragraphs below describe\nthem, and Push's comment describes what the stack adds: focus return, outside clicks, Back, nesting, and following the\nopener after every frame's layout passes (UDreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem::GetOnLayoutPassesFinished).\n\nUMG's combo list lives in the Slate menu stack -- a popup is not a child of the control that\nopened it, which is what keeps it from being clipped by an ancestor's bounds or counted by an\nancestor's layout. This is that idea for a mesh UI, kept deliberately small: the popup STAYS the\nwidget it already was, and the layer only moves it.\n\nElevate reparents the widget under the root it goes up to with its world position kept, so whatever\npositioning its owner ran while it was still a child -- UUIDropdown::Show anchors its list\nagainst the face -- survives the move pixel for pixel. Restore hands it back to the parent it\ncame from; owners that re-position on every open (Show does) need nothing else.\n\nThe root is the player's screen root for UI on a screen. For a tree drawn into the level -- a panel in world space, a\ncanvas drawn into a target a mesh shows -- it is the top of that tree: its popups stay on it, drawn above its content\nin its own plane, as UMG's widget component keeps its menus in its own window (SVirtualWindow::OnQueryPopupMethod\nanswers UseCurrentWindow). Outside presses, Back, the focus and following the opener work there as on a screen.\n\nWhat Elevate alone does not do: outside clicks, focus, nesting of menus, or following a moving\nanchor while open. Push does all four."
    text  "顶层瞬态 UI 会提升到：下拉列表与菜单，作为每个玩家的菜单栈（Push、Dismiss）。\nElevate 与 Restore 只负责提升本身，留给自行管理其余部分的拥有者使用；下面的段落介绍\n它们，而 Push 的注释说明了这个栈额外提供的内容：焦点返回、外部单击、返回、嵌套，以及\n每帧布局过程结束后跟随打开者（UDreamUIManagerWorldSubsystem::GetOnLayoutPassesFinished）。\n\nUMG 的组合框列表位于 Slate 菜单栈中——弹出层并不是打开它的那个控件的子项，\n正因如此它不会被祖先的边界裁剪，也不会被祖先的布局计入。\n本功能就是把这一思路用于网格 UI，并刻意保持精简：弹出层仍是\n它原本的那个控件，层只是移动它。\n\nElevate 会在保持世界位置不变的前提下，把控件重新挂到它所提升到的根之下，因此\n其拥有者在它还是子项时所做的任何定位——UUIDropdown::Show 会把它的列表\n锚定在表面上——都会在移动后逐像素保留。Restore 将它交还给\n它来自的父项；每次打开都会重新定位的拥有者（Show 就是如此）无需再做别的。\n\n对于屏幕上的 UI，根就是玩家的屏幕根。对于绘制到关卡中的树——世界空间中的面板、\n绘制到网格所显示目标的画布——根就是那棵树的顶部：它的弹出层留在其上，绘制在内容之上，\n位于自身平面内，正如 UMG 的控件组件把菜单保留在自己的窗口中（SVirtualWindow::OnQueryPopupMethod\n返回 UseCurrentWindow）。外部按下、返回、焦点以及跟随打开者，在这里与在屏幕上一样工作。\n\n仅靠 Elevate 做不到的是：外部单击、焦点、菜单嵌套，以及在打开期间\n跟随移动的锚点。Push 四项全做。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIPopupLayer:Elevate {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamUIPopupLayer.h#DreamUIPopupLayer:Elevate
    src   "Lift InWidget to the top of the root it goes up to, keeping where it is seen: its player's screen root, or -- when\nInWidget's tree is drawn into the level -- the top of that tree. Safe to call on a widget\nalready lifted (a re-open re-anchored it under its owner first only if it was restored, so a\nsecond Elevate with no Restore in between is a no-op). Returns false when there is no root\nto lift to."
    text  "将 InWidget 提升到它所提升到的根的顶部，并保持其可见位置不变：该玩家的屏幕根，或者——\n当 InWidget 的树绘制到关卡中时——那棵树的顶部。对已经提升过的控件\n调用是安全的（只有在它被 Restore 过之后，重新打开才会先把它重新锚定到其拥有者之下，因此\n中间没有 Restore 的第二次 Elevate 不会产生任何效果）。没有可提升到的根时\n返回 false。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIPopupLayer:Restore {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamUIPopupLayer.h#DreamUIPopupLayer:Restore
    src   "Hand a lifted widget back to the parent Elevate took it from, at the place among its children it had. One still\nopen on the stack (Push) is dismissed first, as its owner closing it would be.\n\nIt goes home as it left: the panel slot it had there is made again with the values it had (Elevate kept a copy --\nsee GetHomeSlot), and the canvas Push sorted it with is undone -- removed when Push added it, its own sorting given\nback when it had one already."
    text  "把已提升的控件交还给 Elevate 取走它的那个父项，并放回它在子项中原先的位置。仍留在\n栈上打开的那个（Push）会先被关闭，与其拥有者将其关闭时一样。\n\n它按离开时的样子回家：它在那里原有的面板插槽会用当时的数值重新创建（Elevate 保存了一份副本——\n参见 GetHomeSlot），Push 对它做的画布排序会被撤销——画布是 Push 添加的则移除，本来就有则\n恢复其自身的排序。"
    state machine
}

