EDreamPopupDismissReason.Replaced {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamUIPopupLayer.h#EDreamPopupDismissReason:Replaced
    src   "Another popup took its place: a new top-level popup of the same player, or a sibling under the same parent. Also a\nmodal shown for the player (UDreamUIModalSubsystem), which comes up in front of all of their popups and closes them."
    text  "另一个弹出层取代了它：同一玩家的新顶层弹出层，或同一父级下的同级项。还有为玩家显示的\n模态（UDreamUIModalSubsystem），它会出现在该玩家的所有弹出层之前并关闭它们。"
    state machine
}

EDreamPopupDismissReason.Tab {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamUIPopupLayer.h#EDreamPopupDismissReason:Tab
    src   "Tab or Shift+Tab, in a popup that closes on Tab (EDreamPopupTabBehavior::CloseAndContinue): every popup of the player\nclosed, top down, and the Tab goes on from the bottom one's opener. An owner commits what was highlighted, as a\ndropdown with bTabCommitsHighlightedRow does. Appended."
    text  "在按下 Tab 即关闭的弹出层（EDreamPopupTabBehavior::CloseAndContinue）中按 Tab 或 Shift+Tab：该玩家的所有弹出层\n自上而下关闭，Tab 从最底层弹出层的打开者继续。拥有者会提交高亮项，如同带\nbTabCommitsHighlightedRow 的下拉列表那样。追加。"
    state machine
}

